!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: day 21 post puromycin selection, Crenolanib
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Puromycin was applied at 2mg/ml concentration for 7 days. Crenolanib (20nM) was applied to 30 million cells in single flask
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = MV411 cells were grown in RPMI-1640, supplemented with 20% serum, pen/strep, fungizone.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = 30 million cells were collected for Crenolanib day 14 and 21. DNA was extracted by desalting method
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = 50 microgramms of DNA were used to PCR amplify library using Herculase II enzyme following published protocols and instructions supplied by authors on Addgene  (Shalem, et al Science 2014. 343(6166): p. 84-87, Tzelepis et al, Cell Rep, 2016. 17(4): p. 1193-1205)
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Shalem et al Science 2014. 343(6166): p. 84-87
!Sample_description = PCR library sequencing
