!Sample_data_processing = Read Trimming: cutadapt -j 2 -n 2 -g ACGAAACACCG -a GTTTAAGAGC  (Version 2.3)
!Sample_data_processing = Alignment: bowtie2 -p 1 -x yusa_library --norc -U {file}.trimmed.fastq {file}.tmp.sam (Version 2.3.5.1)
!Sample_data_processing = Conversion to BAM: samtools view -bS {file}.tmp.sam > {file}.bam (Version 1.9)
!Sample_data_processing = Filter to unique matches allowing no mismatches using bamtools (Version 2.5.1)
!Sample_data_processing = Counting reads for each sgRNA using MAGeCK: mageck count --norm-method none (Version: v0.5.8)
